sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant CL as Clinician
participant EHR as HIS_Country_A
participant MPI as MPI
participant SG as SMART Guidelines Server
participant WHO as "WHO smart-anc (L3) Repo"
participant ITB as ITB

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, ITB: Phase 0: Configure SMART Guidelines on the node
SG->>SG: Deploy FHIR server with CQL engine<br/>(Clinical Reasoning enabled)
WHO->>SG: Load ANCDT01 bundle unedited<br/>(PlanDefinition, CQL Library, ValueSets)
end

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, ITB: Phase 1: Identify the patient
EHR->>MPI: Query Patient<br/>PDQm ITI-78 <G>
MPI-->>EHR: Return patient ITI-78 Response<br/>(200 OK match / 200 OK no match / 404)
end

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, ITB: Phase 2: ANC contact and danger-sign capture
CL->>EHR: Start ANC contact (Encounter)
CL->>EHR: Complete ANC Quick Check - danger signs<br/>(ANC.B5.DE48)
EHR->>EHR: Create Observation per danger sign<br/>(code ANC.B5.DE48, value ANC.B5.DE49-DE62, encounter)
end

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, ITB: Phase 3: Invoke ANC.DT.01 Guideline and return recommendation
EHR->>SG: Request ANC.DT.01 Decision Support<br/>Patient Data Bundle<br/>URL = ANC.DT.01, Subject = Patient, Encounter<br/>required data = Patient, Encounter, Observation (danger signs)
SG->>SG: Evaluate WHO CQL logic (ANC.DT.01)
SG-->>EHR: Return Recommendation<br/>WHO Smart CarePlan with generated actions
EHR->>CL: Display recommendation in ANC Workflow
CL->>EHR: Act on recommendation<br/>Continue ANC contact or referral
end

rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
Note over CL, ITB: Phase 4: Conformance testing (Connectathon only)
EHR->>ITB: Submit ANC.DT.01 test case (input data + CarePlan)
ITB-->>EHR: Validation report
end

